x highlighting.\n\nNetwork: See a list of network requests made by the webpage, with headers and responses. Filter requests, or copy one as a cURL command.\n\nResources: Find details about the data stored by a webpage, such as cookies, local storage, and session storage.\n\nTip: If you tap the Web Inspector button and nothing happens, reload the page once..","released":"2021-09-16","updated":"2026-08-29","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/d2/c1/f6/d2c1f6e0-ca8b-47cf-b7af-4fbfd9cd216e/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-sRGB-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/d2/c1/f6/d2c1f6e0-ca8b-47cf-b7af-4fbfd9cd216e/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-sRGB-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Developer Tools","rating":3.86,"ratings":160,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":0,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":0,"self_n":0,"hn_score":2.0,"first":1687794989,"last":1687794989,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":1,"pos_pct":100,"neg_pct":0,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":36481459,"k":"ios:1584825745","type":"comment","by":"sroussey","time":1687794989,"text":"Use an extension. It will work on any site. Example for iOS: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/web-inspector/id1584825745","title":null,"story_id":36478528,"story_title":"Devtools for mobile browsers","story_score":237,"comments":0,"w":1.0,"u":0,"s":"pos","self":false}],"slug":"web-inspector"}